{{also|Lohikäärme}}
==Finnish==
{{Finnish index|l|o}}

===Alternative forms===
* [[louhikäärme]]

===Etymology===
Partial calque of {{etyl|gmq-osw|fi}} {{term|floghdraki||flying snake|lang=gmq-osw}}; {{compound||alt1=lohi|käärme}}.

===Noun===
{{fi-noun}}

# A [[dragon]].
# A [[wyvern]].

====Declension====
{{fi-decl-hame|lohikäärm|||ä}}

====Usage notes====
* Most Finns don't make a difference between a "wyvern" (''[[traakki]]'') and "dragon" ('''''lohikäärme'''''), and would use ''lohikäärme'' to refer to both.

